  "solution": "Số phần tử của không gian mẫu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>⌀</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> không phải là hai biến cố xung khắc.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"